{"2213450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell Runner", "steam_appid": 2213450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2226270], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump is a timer check. Every mistake is a reset waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Runner</strong> is a precision speedrun platformer built for clean movement, brutal timing, and one-more-run mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the route. Cut the line tighter. Come back faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pure Skill, Pure Speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels are built to be studied, optimized, and mastered. Your first clear is only the beginning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase faster clears through tight platforming and exact timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum, parkour flow, and first/third-person control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, risky lines, and cleaner backup routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay earlier levels with new tools and better execution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push personal bests until every second feels earned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.poster.avif?t=1782965547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.webm?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.mp4?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/ade24bf9dcb376e3e9544ec363d9d632.poster.avif?t=1782965547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/ade24bf9dcb376e3e9544ec363d9d632.webm?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/ade24bf9dcb376e3e9544ec363d9d632.mp4?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through eight themed chapters, each built around new hazards, visual identity, and movement pressure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities That Break Routes Open</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New movement abilities do more than unlock progress. They change how you read every level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump opens tighter vertical routes and recovery plays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telekinesis adds route tech, timing pressure, and puzzle-driven movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rail Gliding turns momentum into high-speed traversal lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight pushes mastery into open-air routing and precision control</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanilla Rush Mode</strong><br>A clean speedrun challenge focused on movement, timing, and execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Rush Mode</strong><br>More pressure, harder mechanics, and less room for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out Discord and Youtube links on the right side.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump is a timer check. Every mistake is a reset waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Runner</strong> is a precision speedrun platformer built for clean movement, brutal timing, and one-more-run mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the route. Cut the line tighter. Come back faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pure Skill, Pure Speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels are built to be studied, optimized, and mastered. Your first clear is only the beginning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase faster clears through tight platforming and exact timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum, parkour flow, and first/third-person control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, risky lines, and cleaner backup routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay earlier levels with new tools and better execution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push personal bests until every second feels earned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.poster.avif?t=1782965547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.webm?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213450/extras/e61eff34cdaab7922de14c36565f3620.mp4?t=1782965547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s